{"id":"b7050f6732cc53d7","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-solovay-lem2.md","title":"Solovay Lemma 2","display":"lem-solovay-lem2 — Solovay Lemma 2","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-solovay-lem2","aliases":["89-lem-solovay-lem2"],"display":"lem-solovay-lem2 — Solovay Lemma 2","depends_on":["[[89-lem-solovay-lem1]]","[[89-df-solovay-realization]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-realization]]","[[89-df-gl-finite-model]]","[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","[[89-df-consistent-pa]]","[[89-df-pa-provable-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-solovay-lem2"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-solovay-lem2</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-solovay-lem2 — Solovay Lemma 2"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c0adaf80b9cae9e6\" href=\"?note=c0adaf80b9cae9e6\" title=\"89-lem-solovay-lem1\">89-lem-solovay-lem1</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97b68cd750e79cac\" href=\"?note=97b68cd750e79cac\" title=\"89-df-solovay-realization\">89-df-solovay-realization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1f581262c09d5e34\" href=\"?note=1f581262c09d5e34\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-realization\">89-df-arithmetical-realization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5026751112f75f31\" href=\"?note=5026751112f75f31\" title=\"89-df-gl-finite-model\">89-df-gl-finite-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8c9363f0c1d91236\" href=\"?note=8c9363f0c1d91236\" title=\"89-df-consistent-pa\">89-df-consistent-pa</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8f382173effd5662\" href=\"?note=8f382173effd5662\" title=\"89-df-pa-provable-formula\">89-df-pa-provable-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span> is a set of Kripke models, and\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,R,V)\\in\\mathrm{GLFMod}(\\mathcal U)\">\\(M=(W,R,V)\\in\\mathrm{GLFMod}(\\mathcal U)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_{0}\\in W\">\\(w_{0}\\in W\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,w_{0}\\not\\models A\">\\(M,w_{0}\\not\\models A\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> is the consistency condition, and\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> is the PA-provable-sentence set.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> is the set of PA arithmetical realizations.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}lem2}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\nM\\in\\mathrm{GLFMod}(\\mathcal U)\n\\land w_{0}\\in W\n\\land M,w_{0}\\not\\models A\n\\land\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau_{\\sigma}\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\;\n\\tau_{\\sigma}(A)\\notin\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}lem2}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\nM\\in\\mathrm{GLFMod}(\\mathcal U)\n\\land w_{0}\\in W\n\\land M,w_{0}\\not\\models A\n\\land\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau_{\\sigma}\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\;\n\\tau_{\\sigma}(A)\\notin\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>从有限点反模型构造一个 PA 算术反解释</li>\n<li>该命题与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c0adaf80b9cae9e6\" href=\"?note=c0adaf80b9cae9e6\" title=\"89-lem-solovay-lem1\">89-lem-solovay-lem1</a> 合成给出算术完全性的逆否方向</li>\n<li>结论是存在一个由 Solovay 构造得到的实现；不在假设中预先固定同名\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_\\sigma\">\\(\\tau_\\sigma\\)</span>，从而避免“先假设见证、再声称存在见证”的循环写法。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-lem-solovay-lem1","status":"resolved","id":"c0adaf80b9cae9e6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-solovay-lem1]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-solovay-realization","status":"resolved","id":"97b68cd750e79cac","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-solovay-realization]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-realization","status":"resolved","id":"1f581262c09d5e34","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-realization]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-finite-model","status":"resolved","id":"5026751112f75f31","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-finite-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-consistent-pa","status":"resolved","id":"8c9363f0c1d91236","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-consistent-pa]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-pa-provable-formula","status":"resolved","id":"8f382173effd5662","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-pa-provable-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-solovay-lem1","status":"resolved","id":"c0adaf80b9cae9e6","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"该命题与 [[89-lem-solovay-lem1]] 合成给出算术完全性的逆否方向","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"M=(W,R,V)\\in\\mathrm{GLFMod}(\\mathcal U)","display":false},{"tex":"w_{0}\\in W","display":false},{"tex":"M,w_{0}\\not\\models A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}lem2}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\nM\\in\\mathrm{GLFMod}(\\mathcal U)\n\\land w_{0}\\in W\n\\land M,w_{0}\\not\\models A\n\\land\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau_{\\sigma}\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\;\n\\tau_{\\sigma}(A)\\notin\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau_\\sigma","display":false}],"bytes":1510,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["c0adaf80b9cae9e6","97b68cd750e79cac","1f581262c09d5e34","5026751112f75f31","9f00301866fbd6f0","8c9363f0c1d91236","8f382173effd5662"]}